00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:17.450
in Jenin,

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:17.884
came under

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.486
fire and responded with shoulder

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.154
fired missiles.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:21.888
A spokesman

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.256
for the Palestinian Authority

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:24.090
president slammed

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.326
the use of missiles as an act of war.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:28.561
Hamas says the target of the raid

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.330
was a member of the militant group

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.531
and had carried out

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.533
last week's attack on the Israeli

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.268
brothers in Hura.

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.003
Settlers went on a rampage

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:38.471
against Palestinians in Juarez

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.239
after that attack,

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.673
killing a civilian

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.242
and triggering and triggering,

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.810
I should say, international demands

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.079
for accountability.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.481
Meanwhile, dozens of Israeli fighter

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:51.017
pilots are joining a growing revolt

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:51.851
within the military

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:52.819
